    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        (World) Building <span class="search-hit mathjax">Transformation</span>: Students and Teachers as CoCreators in OpenXR Learning Environments
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Greenbaum%2C+A">Abigail Greenbaum</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Strickler%2C+E">Elizabeth Strickler</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Patterson%2C+V">Victoria Patterson</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Oluleye%2C+B">Bolu Oluleye</a>
      
