    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Are Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> Capable of Deep Relational Reasoning? Insights from DeepSeek-R1 and Benchmark Comparisons
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=So%2C+C+C">Chi Chiu So</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sun%2C+Y">Yueyue Sun</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+J">Jun-Min Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yung%2C+S+P">Siu Pang Yung</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Loh%2C+A+W+K">Anthony Wai Keung Loh</a>, 
      
