        UrbanLLaVA: A Multi-modal Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> for Urban Intelligence with Spatial Reasoning and Understanding
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Feng%2C+J">Jie Feng</a>, 
      
